{"t":"Nightmare Teddy Quest","s":"nightmare-teddy-quest-5e8fa","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Full_map_to_Nightmare_Teddy_63d571.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Nightmare Teddy Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"timealloc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Est. Length</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15 minutes</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(250+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.80<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 21, 2015<br/>Summer Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>Nightmarish creatures are guarding something very appropriate to their nature...\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Isles\">Nightmare Isles</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Silencer\">Silencers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Retching%20Horror\">Retching Horrors</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Choking%20Fear\">Choking Fears</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Terrorsleep\">Terrorsleeps</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Teddy\">Nightmare Teddy</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 330px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Full map to Nightmare Teddy\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"363\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Full_map_to_Nightmare_Teddy_63d571.png\" width=\"330\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>When the <a href=\"#/quest/nightmare-isles-mini-world-change\">Nightmare Isles Mini World Change</a> is active, travel to <a href=\"#/wiki/Darama\">Darama</a> in order to find a portal which, depending on the specific message, will have appeared <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33037,32404,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33037, 32404, 7)</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33265,32653,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33265, 32653, 7)</a> or <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33216,32273,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33216, 32273, 7)</a>. You will be teleported to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Isles\">Nightmare Isles</a>, which are filled with <a href=\"#/wiki/Silencer\">Silencers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Retching%20Horror\">Retching Horrors</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Choking%20Fear\">Choking Fears</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Terrorsleep\">Terrorsleeps</a>.\n</p><p>Make your way onto the islet containing the only <a href=\"#/wiki/Terrorsleep\">Terrorsleeps</a>. You will find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Chest%20of%20Drawers%20%28Quest%29\">Chest of Drawers (Quest)</a> here, which can only be opened by players who have taken part in killing all six Terrorsleeps. After doing so, use the drawers to open them and receive your reward, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare%20Teddy\">Nightmare Teddy</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["asura-palace-quest"]}